"""Finite stdlib CPU-only test supervisor; run only after the separate ROOT gate.

Uses process-ownership helpers, never GPU guard main/run/flock. NativePool is read
only and its existing output stays absent. Tests write only new owned scratch and
bounded evidence. Sampled RSS is not a hard kernel memory quota.
"""

